    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: Until the day her age reaches the range applicable by the compulsory education
      law, $$where I'm forced to go out.
    displayText: Until the day her age reaches the range applicable by the compulsory
      education law, where I'm forced to go out.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: dd7424e912b1ed242be9b05b9e0c8d66, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.036
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 5400000054000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: Why can't you just say until she starts going to school?
